-- WARN: REQUIREMENTS.md § 13.7. Split off `0027` because `pnpm db:migrate` runs files rather than the comment that used to warn about this one. `sort_order` is NOT NULL in the deployed schema and the two apps deploy separately onto one database, so dropping it in the same migration that adds `position` puts whichever app is still running the old code into a 500 for the whole gap between the two deploys.
-- WARN: The order is add-and-backfill (`0027`), then **both** apps deployed, then this. Applied together they are the same thing they always were; applied apart they are what makes the schema change survivable.ALTER TABLE "user_emoticon_prefs" DROP COLUMN "sort_order";
